      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Chain a multiple of 6 plus 2. Row 1: dc in 2nd ch from hook and each ch to end. Turn." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Shell row" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Row 2: sl st 1, skip 2 dc, *5 tr in next dc (shell made), skip 2 dc, sl st in next dc, ch 1, sl st in next dc, skip 2 dc; repeat from * placing a shell every 6th base stitch. End with a shell followed by sl st into the last dc. Fasten off." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
